esterne.

35
00:00:31,536 --> 00:00:32,686
Quando fuori
soffia

36
00:00:32,686 --> 00:00:33,837
un vento secco,

37
00:00:33,837 --> 00:00:34,988
come
il maestrale,

38
00:00:34,988 --> 00:00:36,139
l'aria rimane
stabile e

39
00:00:36,139 --> 00:00:36,721
la

40
00:00:36,721 --> 00:00:37,303
