160
00:02:31,749 --> 00:02:32,820
soltanto
riflessi:
osserviamo

161
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:33,892
il tempo, il

162
00:02:33,892 --> 00:02:34,963
clima e la

163
00:02:34,963 --> 00:02:36,035
